    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41423" root="هوش" body-key="h">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَاوَشَهُمْ</span></b>  <i>He mixed, mingled,</i> or <i>consorted,
with them:</i> (K:) or <i>did so to create,</i> or <i>excite,
disorder, disturbance, discord,</i> or <i>dissension;</i> or
<i>to make mischief:</i> (TA:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهَاوَشَةٌ</span> signifies
<i>conflicting;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنَاوَشَةٌ</span>. (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نوش</span>.)

